  "description": "The meme uses the technique of juxtaposing two contrasting ideas — the joyful, aspirational image of homeownership and the ridiculous, impractical appliance suggestion — to create humor. This technique relies on the viewer’s understanding of satire and irony as comedic devices, which are common in popular culture and media.",
